# With a single maintainer this changes nothing today. It is here for the day it
# does: the moment anyone else gets write access, the paths below stop being
# self-mergeable by accident.
*                           @ssh-ai

# A subtle change here weakens the encryption for every call without breaking a
# single test. This is the file class that must never merge unreviewed.
/packages/protocol/         @ssh-ai
/rust/crates/magpie-protocol/  @ssh-ai

# Both decide what a user's machine downloads and executes, and both run with
# more privilege than the product does.
/.github/workflows/         @ssh-ai
/scripts/                   @ssh-ai
